    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"embracing the mud\" just feels like accepting a slow, ugly death of everything i used to be. if i just let it happen, i'm just watching myself disappear into something pathetic. i don't want to \"heal\" into a version of myself that is lesser. i want to stop the rot. isn't there a way to just... exit? to keep the art clean by making sure the artist doesn't live long enough to become the mistake?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
